      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is also an issue on YouTubes own website btw. if I watch something that was originally in German, YouTube will always default to the english audio track if it exists.\n\nHowever in that case it's only a minor annoyance, as I can always just change it my self. This is not the case in VRChat though, which makes this problem extremely annoying.",
